<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">MOVE WITH A PLAN</view><view class="title">让每一堂课，都有期待</view><view class="subtitle">课程安排 · 动作示范 · 训练准备</view><demo-notice/><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error" bindtap="refresh">{{error}} · 点击重试</view><view class="card calendar-card"><view class="calendar-header"><button class="month-arrow" bindtap="previous" aria-label="上个月">‹</button><view bindtap="today"><view class="month-title">{{month}}</view><view class="calendar-hint">点击回到今天</view></view><button class="month-arrow" bindtap="next" aria-label="下个月">›</button></view><view class="weekday-row"><text wx:for="{{weekLabels}}" wx:key="*this">{{item}}</text></view><view class="calendar-grid"><view wx:for="{{calendarDays}}" wx:key="date" class="calendar-day {{item.inMonth?'':'outside'}} {{item.selected?'selected':''}} {{item.isToday?'today':''}}" bindtap="select" data-date="{{item.date}}"><view class="day-number">{{item.day}}</view><view wx:if="{{item.count}}" class="lesson-tag">{{item.label}}</view><view wx:else="" class="rest-dot"/></view></view><view class="calendar-key"><text class="lesson-dot"/>有课程安排<text class="today-dot"/>今天</view></view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="empty">正在读取课程安排…</view><view class="section"><text>{{selectedDate}} 的安排</text><text class="section-note">{{selectedLessons.length}} 节课</text></view><view wx:for="{{selectedLessons}}" wx:key="id" class="card lesson-card"><view class="row"><view class="lesson-time">{{item.time}}</view><text class="pill">{{isDemo?'演示课表':'课程安排'}}</text></view><view class="lesson-title">{{item.title}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.class_name}} · {{item.location}}</view><view class="lesson-focus">{{item.focus}}</view><button class="secondary" bindtap="tutorial" data-id="{{item.id}}">课前看看动作示范 →</button></view><view wx:if="{{!loading ? !selectedLessons.length : false}}" class="card empty">今天没有课程安排<view class="muted topgap">也可以先去示范库看看标准动作</view></view><button class="primary" bindtap="library">打开动作示范库</button><view class="hint">{{isDemo?'当前为样例月课表，未读取学校课程安排。课程和训练记录分别管理，不把计划当作已完成训练。':'课程由已配置的数据服务提供。'}}</view></view>
